SDL-E1046 (spec/table.md)

  x a nested index cannot carry `on:` — it inherits its host table
   ,----
 1 | table t { index u { on: t; fields: a; }; };
   :               ^|
   :                `-- a nested definition inherits its table
   `----
  help: remove the `on:` clause — this index inherits its host table from the `table` block; the standalone `on:` is for the top-level form
